 flex-col items-center gap-4  self-stretch lg:items-start"><p class="flex !h-[30px]  text-center  text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.084px] text-[#344054] md:text-xl md:leading-[1.875rem] md:tracking-[-0.12px] lg:text-start"><div class="flex flex-col text-[#FF4D3C] whitespace-nowrap"><p><span>Hi I'm </span><span><span class="text-[#FF4D3C] whitespace-nowrap">&nbsp;ProPilot</span></span></p><p></p></div></p><p class="self-stretch text-center text-3xl font-semibold leading-[38px] tracking-[-0.190px] text-[#101828]  md:text-5xl md:leading-[60px] md:tracking-[-0.196px] lg:text-start">Your Personal <span class="whitespace-nowrap">AI <svg width="32" height="34" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" class="mb-1 inline md:scale-[1.4]"><path fill="url(#Stars2_svg__a)" d="M0 .5h32v33.455H0z"></path><defs><pattern id="Stars2_svg__a" patternContentUnits="objectBoundingBox" width="1" height="1"><use xlink:href="#Stars2_svg__b" transform="matrix(.00864 0 0 .00826 -.018 0)"></use></pattern><image id="Stars2_svg__b" width="120" height="121" xlink:href="data:image/png;base64,"></image></defs></svg> </span> Career Assistant</p><h1 class=" text-center text-base tracking-[0.096px] text-[#667085]  md:text-xl  md:leading-[1.875rem] md:tracking-[-0.12px] lg:text-start">Tell me your career goal, and I'll help you achieve it - the fastest route, no detours. </h1></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-2 md:w-auto lg:items-start lg:gap-4"><a class=" h-12 w-full whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg !bg-[#101828] px-[18px] py-[10px] text-center text-base font-normal leading-6 tracking-[0.096px] !text-white md:w-auto md:px-5 md:py-3 md:text-left md:font-medium" href="https://www.preplaced.in/mentorai/pro-pilot/dashboard?screen=roadmap&amp;onboarding=true">Get My Roadmap <span class="hidden md:inline-block">-&gt;</span></a><div class="mt-[-8px] flex items-center justify-center gap-1"><p class=" text-sm  font-medium leading-5 tracking-[0.08